      "nets": ["NET0001", "U11.OUT/J12.2"],
      "observed": "The D8/R2 indicator is connected from NET0001, the MCU heater-control net, to GND. It is not connected to U11.OUT, the switched heater-output net.",
      "expected": "The specification says the status LED and series resistor are on the HEATER output net, so the indicator should reflect the switched output rather than just the MCU command.",
